# What a headset app has beyond its window: a second window, an ornament on the window's edge, a context menu
# by a long press, and a space around the user with 3D content that names itself for accessibility (XCUITest
# sees it but cannot press it: it has no activation point).
open!
wait id=title 30
press id=open_window
wait id=second_window 10
press id=greet
expect text="Hello, stranger"
press id=ornament_button
expect text="ornament pressed"
longpress id=menu_target
press text="Copy"
expect text="copied"
press id=enter_space
wait text="in space" 15
wait text="space box" 10
press id=leave_space
wait text="no space" 10
wait gone text="space box" 10
press id=close_window
wait gone id=second_window 10
key home
open
wait id=title 20
